const hello=h=>h<5?"سهران يا محمد؟":h<12?"صباح الخير يا محمد":h<17?"نهارك سعيد يا محمد":h<21?"مساء الخير يا محمد":"ليلتك سعيدة يا محمد";
const dateLong=d=>`${DAYS[d.getDay()]} ${d.getDate()} ${MONTHS[d.getMonth()]}`;
const dayDiff=(iso,now)=>{
  const a=new Date(iso+"T00:00:00"),b=new Date(isoOf(now)+"T00:00:00");
  return Math.round((a-b)/864e5);
};

function buildTimeline(iso,dow,col,cinfo){
  const items=[];
  (SCHEDULE[dow]||[]).forEach(c=>items.push({a:toMin(c.a),b:toMin(c.b),t:c.s,sub:`${KIND[c.k].n} · ${c.r} · ${c.t}`,c:KIND[c.k].c}));
  const exam=EXAMS.find(e=>e.d===iso);
  if(exam)items.push({a:toMin(EXAM_START),b:toMin(EXAM_END),t:`امتحان ${exam.s}`,sub:"ميد تيرم · 10:00 – 11:00",c:"red"});
  const busy=items.length>0;
  const first=busy?Math.min(...items.map(x=>x.a)):600;
  const lastEnd=busy?Math.max(...items.map(x=>x.b)):0;
  const wakeA=Math.max(360,first-75);
  items.push({a:wakeA,b:wakeA+15,t:"ابدأ يومك",sub:"بص على مهامك وجهّز لأول حاجة",c:"gray"});
  let t=busy?lastEnd+60:660;
  if(exam)t=Math.max(t,720);
  t=Math.ceil(t/5)*5;
  const cm=Math.min(180,Math.max(45,col.reduce((a,x)=>a+x.m,0)));
  items.push({a:t,b:t+cm,t:"مذاكرة الكلية",sub:uniq(col.map(x=>x.s)).slice(0,3).join(" · "),c:"blue"});
  t+=cm+15;
  if(cinfo){items.push({a:t,b:t+60,t:"سايبر سيكيورتي",sub:cinfo.title,c:"green"});t+=75}
  items.push({a:t,b:t+15,t:"مراجعة سريعة وتخطيط بكرة",sub:"اقفل اليوم وشوف بكرة فيه إيه",c:"gray"});
  return items.sort((x,y)=>x.a-y.a);
}


function renderToday(){
  const now=new Date(),iso=isoOf(now),dow=now.getDay();
  $("#tDate").textContent=dateLong(now);
  $("#tHello").textContent=hello(now.getHours());

  const col=collegeTasks(iso,dow);
  const ref=cyberToday(iso);
  const cinfo=ref?refInfo(ref):null;
  const cust=custom[iso]||[];

  const total=col.length+(cinfo?1:0)+cust.length;
  const dn=col.filter(x=>done[x.id]).length+(cinfo&&cinfo.done?1:0)+cust.filter(x=>done[x.id]).length;
  const pct=total?Math.round(dn/total*100):0;
  const st=streak();

  /* summary */
  $("#tSummary").innerHTML=`
  <div class="summary glass">
    <div class="ring">
      <svg width="84" height="84" viewBox="0 0 64 64">
        <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="26" fill="none" stroke="rgba(118,118,128,.16)" stroke-width="7"/>
        <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="26" fill="none" stroke="url(#rg)" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="${pct?"round":"butt"}" stroke-dasharray="${(pct*1.634).toFixed(1)} 163.4" style="transition:stroke-dasharray .8s"/>
        <defs><linearGradient id="rg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#5ac8fa"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#007aff"/></linearGradient></defs>
      </svg>
      <b>${pct}%</b>
    </div>
    <div class="fx">
      <h3>${dn===total&&total?"خلّصت يومك":"خلّصت "+dn+" من "+total}</h3>
      <div class="sub">${dn===total&&total?"عاش، اقفل اليوم وارتاح":"كمّل خطوة خطوة"}</div>
      <div class="stats">
        <span class="stat-chip"><i class="fa-solid fa-fire"></i> ${st} ${st===1?"يوم":"أيام"} متتالية</span>
        <span class="stat-chip b"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> ${cyberPercent()}% سايبر</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>`;

  /* next exam */
  const nowT=Date.now();
  const nx=EXAMS.find(e=>new Date(`${e.d}T${EXAM_END}:00`).getTime()>nowT);
  if(nx){
    const dd=dayDiff(nx.d,now);
    const big=dd===0?"النهاردة":dd===1?"بكرة":dd;
    $("#tExam").innerHTML=`
    <div class="exam glass">
      <div class="exam-n">${big}${typeof big==="number"?"<small>يوم</small>":""}</div>
      <div class="fx"><div class="sub">الامتحان الجاي</div><div class="ttl" style="font-size:17px;direction:ltr;text-align:right">${esc(nx.s)}</div>
      <div class="sub">${dateLong(new Date(nx.d+"T12:00:00"))} · 10:00 – 11:00</div></div>
      <i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-half" style="color:var(--orange);font-size:20px"></i>
    </div>`;
  }else $("#tExam").innerHTML="";

  /* tasks */
  const taskRow=t=>`
    <div class="row ${t.done?"done":""}">
      <button class="ck" type="button" data-act="${t.act}" data-id="${esc(t.id)}" aria-label="تم"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></button>
      <div class="fx"><div class="ttl">${esc(t.title)}</div><div class="sub">${t.sub}</div></div>
      ${t.del?"":`<button class="chip w" type="button" data-ai-ask="${esc(t.act==="cy"?`اشرحلي "${t.title}" بالتفصيل وبأمثلة بسيطة، وبعدها اسألني 3 أسئلة تثبيت.`:`ساعدني أذاكر: ${t.title}`)}" aria-label="اسأل المساعد"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i></button>`}
      ${t.link?`<a class="chip" href="${esc(safeUrl(t.link))}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">فتح</a>`:""}
      ${t.del?`<button class="del" type="button" data-act="del" data-id="${esc(t.id)}" aria-label="حذف"><i class="fa-solid fa-trash-can"></i></button>`:""}
    </div>`;

  let html=`<div class="glass group">`;
  html+=`<div class="sec-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap" style="color:var(--blue)"></i> الكلية</div>`;
  html+=col.map(x=>taskRow({act:"c",id:x.id,title:x.t,sub:`<span class="tag t-blue">${esc(x.s)}</span> · ${x.m} دقيقة`,done:!!done[x.id]})).join("");
  html+=`<div class="sec-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" style="color:var(--green)"></i> سايبر سيكيورتي</div>`;
  html+=cinfo?taskRow({act:"cy",id:cinfo.id,title:cinfo.title,sub:`<span class="tag t-green">${esc(cinfo.sub)}</span>`,link:cinfo.link,done:cinfo.done})
    :`<div class="row"><div class="fx"><div class="ttl">خلّصت المسار كله 🎉</div><div class="sub">كمّل مشاريعك وحضّر للشهادات</div></div></div>`;
  if(cust.length){
    html+=`<div class="sec-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check" style="color:var(--orange)"></i> مهامي</div>`;
    html+=cust.map(x=>taskRow({act:"c",id:x.id,title:x.t,sub:"مهمة شخصية",done:!!done[x.id],del:true})).join("");
  }
  html+=`</div>`;
  $("#tTasks").innerHTML=html;

  /* timeline */
  const nm=now.getHours()*60+now.getMinutes();
  const tl=buildTimeline(iso,dow,col,cinfo);
  const inExamWeek=iso>=EXAMS[0].d&&iso<=EXAMS[EXAMS.length-1].d;
  $("#tTimeline").innerHTML=`<div class="glass group">`+tl.map(x=>`
    <div class="tl ${x.b<=nm?"past":""} ${x.a<=nm&&nm<x.b?"now":""}">
      <div class="time">${fmt(x.a)} – ${fmt(x.b)}</div>
      <div class="bar ${x.c}"></div>
      <div class="fx"><div class="ttl" style="direction:auto">${esc(x.t)}</div><div class="sub">${esc(x.sub)}</div></div>
    </div>`).join("")+
    (inExamWeek?`<div class="note">أسبوع امتحانات — اتأكد من الكلية لو المحاضرات شغالة أو متأجلة.</div>`:"")+`</div>`;

  paintQuote();
  renderAIBrief();
}

